{"id":"n57469-1-5","stage":4,"title":"몰입 · 埋头","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57469-1-5-1","ko":"야, 몇 번을 불렀는데도 왜 대답이 없어?","zh":"喂，叫了好几声你怎么都不回答啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"야,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"야：喂","readings":[{"term":"야","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58149","senseId":"2","lemma":"야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"번을","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번을","audio":"/audio/a635bf87edeb018cf88d.mp3"}},{"text":"불렀는데도","meaning":"叫","explanation":"부르다：叫；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"1","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불렀는데도","audio":"/audio/041a8f45f6a04e44ce35.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"대답이","meaning":"应答，回应，回复","explanation":"대답：应答，回应，回复；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"대답","audio":"/audio/bd8a8d233373a1c01779.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64540","senseId":"1","lemma":"대답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대답이","audio":"/audio/fbe1bfe89211576ec856.mp3"}},{"text":"없어?","meaning":"不在","explanation":"없다：不在；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"7","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08945f015d460ad9","term":"야","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3","entryId":"58149","definition":"大人叫孩子时，或者年龄相等的人之间招呼时用的词语。","pronunciation":["야ː"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"叫","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3","entryId":"57304","definition":"用言行让别人过来，或吸引注意力。","pronunciation":["부르다"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"bd8a8d233373a1c0","term":"대답","zh":"应答，回应，回复","audio":"/audio/bd8a8d233373a1c01779.mp3","entryId":"64540","definition":"对招呼的话做出回话；或指那样的话。","pronunciation":["대ː답"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不在","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人、事物、现象等不占据某处或空间。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5300c6312a4c6d4044a4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57469-1-5-2","ko":"그랬어? 내가 하나에 몰입을 하면 누가 불러도 잘 몰라.","zh":"是吗？我一旦专心做一件事，就算有人叫我也没反应。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그랬어?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그랬어","audio":"/audio/d60557f7f56a03856469.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"하나에","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나에","audio":"/audio/a64a32540e921d3a7605.mp3"}},{"text":"몰입을","meaning":"埋头，专心","explanation":"몰입：埋头，专心；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"몰입","audio":"/audio/16a2a43f1fe3e22c166f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57469","senseId":"1","lemma":"몰입","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰입을","audio":"/audio/ba5b4a7ed49cd6c06281.mp3"}},{"text":"하면","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하면","audio":"/audio/01692c67203f44175054.mp3"}},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"불러도","meaning":"请，叫","explanation":"부르다：请，叫；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"9","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불러도","audio":"/audio/dba9e37a66864ffaaf6b.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"仔细地，专注地","explanation":"잘：仔细地，专注地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"11","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"몰라.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰라","audio":"/audio/8884d387268b95cb0579.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20279","definition":"数数时的第一个数字。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"16a2a43f1fe3e22c","term":"몰입","zh":"埋头，专心","audio":"/audio/16a2a43f1fe3e22c166f.mp3","entryId":"57469","definition":"不关心别的事情，把精力完全集中在一件事情上，深深地投入进去。","pronunciation":["모립"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"请，叫","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3","entryId":"57304","definition":"请求对方过来。","pronunciation":["부르다"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"仔细地，专注地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"集中注意力地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","z